<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Baculites compressus at 94.16 µm (Pass 1) — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "k_c, σ(k), the ablation, and χ are each a named function. The flank wavenumber k0 = 0.12 rad/px is a photograph-scale packet, not the 94.16 µm chemical wavenumber, and that distinction lives in the docstring rather than a cited equation number." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Baculites compressus at 94.16 µm (Pass 1) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Jacobian, k_c formula, analytic eigenvalue, and the periodic integrator implement Turing 1952 / Schnakenberg 1979. r = 9.2 is held just above the computed threshold so the selected band sits on the assigned wavelength. The flank image is a seeded Fourier packet, not the time-integrated field." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength of Baculites compressus at 94.16 µm (Pass 1) — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion r = 0.99966 with RMSE 0.00884 at dt = 0.12 of the stability bound; ablation σ is negative; λ_max = 96.54 µm against the 94.16 µm reference; the Kevmin section is segmented (area 0.427, aspect 2.62). KS, radial-FFT r, and coherency are printed on the figure. The timestep has not yet been tightened." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
