        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-shell-foreground-fraction-segmented-from-the-kevmin-specimen>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-simulation-structure-tensor-coherency-on-the-flank-frame>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-baculites-compressus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-versus-simulation-orientation-histogram-ks-statistic>,
